    url:
    description: Annual street-lighting electricity for Mainz, 2014-2024, kWh/a.
      Billed through Mainzer Netze / Tiefbauamt rather than through the 
      Gebaeudewirtschaft SAP-EM system municipal_building_energy comes from, 
      which is why it is a separate dataset and node rather than an extra 
      facility-type row there. Delivered 2026-03-31 and prepared by Kausal in 
      AUFBEREITET_EKA-RLP-Datenservice_Strom_Gas_2014-24_geliefert20260331.xlsx,
      sheet "Strom", column "Strom Straßenbeleuchtung". Full 2014-2024 series, 
      no gaps; gradual decline (7.5 to 6.6 GWh) consistent with LED retrofits.
  units:
    energy: kWh/a
